//RS //! D-JPK-TOOLRUN1 (card #477): `jetpack tool install|list|uninstall`.
//RS //!
//RS //! Ephemeral package shells use `jetpack use`. Persistent `tool install`
//RS //! projects bins onto `~/.jet/bin` with generation metadata. A bin name that
//RS //! collides with a project `#Job fn` is E1297 (JPK-TOOL-COLLIDE); an
//RS //! external provider prefix with no hangar realization path is E1298
//RS //! (JPK-TOOL-PROVIDER). Split out per the `tests/jetpack.rs` -> per-card-file
//RS //! convention (see `tests/jetpack_tasks.rs`); shared fixtures/helpers come
//RS //! from `tests/support/jetpack_fixtures.rs` (see `tests/jetpack_engine.rs`).
